{"id":"capacidad","lemma":"capacidad","pos":"noun","rank":1941,"glosses":["capacity, capability, ability","capacity (measure of the ability to hold)","capacity (maximum that can be held)"],"ipa":"/kapaθiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"capacidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-capacidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tienes la capacidad para hacer eso?","en":"Do you have the ability to do that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819872","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"No tengo mucha fe en sus capacidades.","en":"I don't have much faith in his ability.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608632","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"faith"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"He llegado al límite de mi capacidad.","en":"I've reached the limits of my ability.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456716","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"arrived"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"limit"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Yo creo en mis capacidades.","en":"I believe in my abilities.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Él confía en su capacidad.","en":"He has confidence in his ability.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684409","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to reassure","l":"confiar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}